        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-danio-albolineatus-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-seed-ensemble-wavelength-cv>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-danio-albolineatus-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-simulated-stripe-critical-wavelength>,
